<title>USA: Taiwan to seek 113,000 T U.S. wheat - exporters.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to seek 113,000 T U.S. wheat - exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan will seek a total of 113,000 tonnes U.S. wheat in two separate tenders, several exporters said.</p>
<p>One tender for 61,000 tonnes will be issued on May 13 and another for 52,000 tonnes will come out May 14, several U.S. exporters said.</p>
